=== 1. Rāgasuttaṃ
<rāgasuttaṃ>
#block[
#set enum(numbering: "1.", start: 107)
+ ‘‘Tayome, bhikkhave, dhammā. Katame tayo? Rāgo, doso, moho. Ime kho,
  bhikkhave, tayo dhammā. Imesaṃ kho, bhikkhave, tiṇṇaṃ dhammānaṃ
  pahānāya tayo dhammā bhāvetabbā. Katame tayo? Rāgassa pahānāya asubhā
  bhāvetabbā, dosassa pahānāya mettā bhāvetabbā, mohassa pahānāya paññā
  bhāvetabbā. Imesaṃ kho, bhikkhave, tiṇṇaṃ dhammānaṃ pahānāya ime tayo
  dhammā bhāvetabbā''ti. Paṭhamaṃ.
